<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr-blood-brothers-v36" name="Blood Brothers - Draft" revision="4" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules>































<rule id="opr-blood-000001" name="Bloodborn" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified hit roll of 6 when attacking, this model may roll one extra attack with that weapon. Newly generated attacks cannot generate further attacks.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000002" name="Enhanced Bloodborn" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Bloodborn, extra attacks are generated on successful unmodified hit rolls of 5–6 instead of only 6.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000003" name="Predator" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified hit roll of 6 when attacking, this model may roll one extra attack with that weapon. Newly generated attacks cannot generate further attacks.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000004" name="Enhanced Predator" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Predator, extra attacks are generated on successful unmodified hit rolls of 5–6 instead of only 6.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000006" name="Evasive" hidden="false"><description>Enemies suffer -1 to hit against units where most models have this rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000007" name="Melee Shrouding" hidden="false"><description>Enemies charging a unit where most models have this rule reduce charge range by 2 inches, minimum 6 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000008" name="Mend" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation before attacking, remove D3 wounds from one friendly Tough model within 3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00000a" name="Rapid Rush" hidden="false"><description>Add 6 inches to this model's Rush movement.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00000b" name="Re-Deployment" hidden="false"><description>After deployment excluding reserved units, redeploy up to two friendly units. Players alternate, beginning with the next activating player.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00000c" name="Smash" hidden="false"><description>Against targets beyond half weapon range, unmodified Defense rolls of 6 must be rerolled.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00000e" name="Unstoppable Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation before attacking, mark one visible enemy within 18 inches; friendly weapons gain Unstoppable against it for the next applicable instance.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00000f" name="Vanguard" hidden="false"><description>After deployment, reposition fully within 9 inches of the original position and more than 9 inches from enemies without Vanguard.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000010" name="Versatile Expert" hidden="false"><description>On activation choose AP(+1) on weapons or +1 to hit for models with this rule in the unit, until activation ends.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000011" name="Versatile Reach" hidden="false"><description>On activation choose +4 inches shooting range or +2 inches charge movement for models with this rule, until activation ends.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000012" name="Bane in Melee Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Bane on melee weapons.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000013" name="Bane when Shooting Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Bane on ranged weapons.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000014" name="Bravery Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain +1 to Morale tests.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000015" name="Enhanced Bloodborn Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Bloodborn.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000016" name="Melee Shrouding Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Melee Shrouding.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000017" name="Rapid Rush Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Rapid Rush.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000018" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000019" name="Versatile Reach Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Versatile Reach.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001a" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>Armor protection of 2+ while equipped.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001b" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>Ignore the target's cover protection when attacking.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001c" name="Blood Dome (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one friendly unit within 12 inches, which gets Evasive once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001d" name="Heavenly Lance (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 18 inches in line of sight, which takes 2 hits with AP(1). Resolve as if the target were a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001e" name="Blood Sight (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two enemy units within 18 inches in line of sight. Friendly units get Unstoppable on their weapons when shooting against them once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-00001f" name="Shield Breaker (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12 inches in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Shred.</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000020" name="Burst of Rage (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18 inches, which get Enhanced Bloodborn once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-blood-000021" name="Blood Trauma (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 24 inches in line of sight, which takes 6 hits with AP(1) and Smash.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries>




























